name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q2_2025'

question 'A clothing store\'s website has a "Try It On" button that lets you see how a shirt looks in different colors when you click each option. What principle of good interactive design does this feature show?'

right 'It gives users feedback that helps them see the result of their choice right away.'
wrong 'It hides all the color options to make the site load faster.'
wrong 'It limits users to only one color so they don\'t get overwhelmed.'
wrong 'It automatically changes every product on the page to match the new color.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

